GCOUNT  =                    1 / number of groups                               TFIELDS =                    1 / number of fields in each row                   ZIMAGE  =                    T / extension contains compressed image            ZTENSION= 'IMAGE   '           / Image extension                                ZBITPIX =                   32 / array data type                                ZNAXIS  =                    2 / number of array dimensions                     ZNAXIS1 =                    5                                                  ZNAXIS2 =                    5                                                  ZPCOUNT =                    0 / number of parameters                           ZGCOUNT =                    1 / number of groups                               ZTILE1  =                    5 / size of tiles to be compressed                 ZTILE2  =                    1 / size of tiles to be compressed                 ZCMPTYPE= 'RICE_1  '           / compression algorithm                          ZNAME1  = 'BLOCKSIZE'          / compression block size                         ZVAL1   =                   32 / pixels per block                               ZNAME2  = 'BYTEPIX '           / bytes per pixel (1, 2, 4, or 8)                ZVAL2   =                    4 / bytes per pixel (1, 2, 4, or 8)                EXTNAME = 'FLAGS   '           / name of this binary table extension            EXTTYPE = 'MASK    '           / Extension can be used as a mask overlay        WCSAXES =                    2 / Number of coordinate axes                      CRPIX1  =      2303.1741935484 / Pixel coordinate of reference point            CRPIX2  =                983.4 / Pixel coordinate of reference point            PC1_1   =     0.99640353233263 / Coordinate transformation matrix element       PC1_2   =   -0.084734885112621 / Coordinate transformation matrix element       PC2_1   =    0.084734885112621 / Coordinate transformation matrix element       